    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Monique Kim grew up in Montreal's Chinatown, the daughter of a gallery owner murdered before her eyes during a robbery; shuffled through neglectful and abusive foster homes, she found solace only in sculpture, working in jade, marble and silver but never finding the medium that let her truly express herself. Destitute after her artistic career collapsed into addiction, she was Embraced and initially worked as a @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat} silversmith &mdash; until she met the Rose and learned Vicissitude, finally discovering her true medium: living human flesh. Taking the name Creamy Jade, she has become fixated on preserving childhood innocence by Embracing children, a project that has repeatedly failed as her childer become small demons rather than the angels she seeks.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Seductive like all the Widows; you hide your face behind a fan and let your two attendants speak for you. An artist first, with little patience for anything but creation and passion.</p><h2>Secrets</h2><p>Creamy Jade knows a great deal about the city's affairs and has assisted Zarnovich in his experiments.</p>",
    "notes": "Embraced 1972. Apparent age: early 20s. @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.paths-of-enlightenment.JournalEntry.exke2riW9D0htoUu]{Path of Cathari} 9. Disciplines (as printed): Auspex 5, Celerity 3, Presence 4, Thaumaturgy 3 (Conjuring 3), Vicissitude 3.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
